{"id":"0c3f0ebd14bbbad8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-low-pa.md","title":"低PA度存在","display":"thm-low-pa — 低PA度存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-low-pa","aliases":["43-thm-low-pa"],"display":"thm-low-pa — 低PA度存在","depends_on":["[[43-df-pa-degree]]","[[43-df-low-high]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.18.6, print p.72 / PDF p.92","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-low-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-low-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-pa — 低PA度存在"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15f1f418de3165e2\" href=\"?note=15f1f418de3165e2\" title=\"43-df-pa-degree\">43-df-pa-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7449d7fd44914a58\" href=\"?note=7449d7fd44914a58\" title=\"43-df-low-high\">43-df-low-high</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.18.6, print p.72 / PDF p.92"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>量化于自然数子集。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15f1f418de3165e2\" href=\"?note=15f1f418de3165e2\" title=\"43-df-pa-degree\">43-df-pa-degree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7449d7fd44914a58\" href=\"?note=7449d7fd44914a58\" title=\"43-df-low-high\">43-df-low-high</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对完整一致PA扩张的有效闭类应用低基定理；原书将其列为低基定理的首个历史应用。完整PA扩张类的非空性依通常PA一致性事实。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.18.6, print p.72 / PDF p.92。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pa-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"7449d7fd44914a58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-low-high]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"7449d7fd44914a58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-low-high]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Low}(A)).","display":true}],"bytes":1001,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-low-p